<view class="page-root {{themeClass}} search-root">

  <!-- 顶部搜索栏（padding-top 取胶囊按钮下沿，确保输入框不被胶囊遮挡） -->
  <view class="bar" style="padding-top:{{navTop}}px;padding-right:{{capsuleRight}}px;">
    <view class="back tappable" bindtap="back">‹</view>
    <view class="input-wrap card">
      <text class="s-ico">🔍</text>
      <input class="s-input flex-1" placeholder="搜物品、Boss、配方、攻略，支持拼音/俗称" placeholder-class="ph"
        value="{{kw}}" bindinput="onKw" bindconfirm="confirmSearch" confirm-type="search"
        focus maxlength="20" />
      <text class="s-clear tappable" wx:if="{{kw}}" bindtap="clearKw">✕</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="body" scroll-y>
    <!-- 搜索结果 -->
    <block wx:if="{{kw}}">
      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{results.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">图鉴条目</text>
        <text class="more px">{{results.length}} 条</text>
      </view>
      <view class="r-item card tappable" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onResult" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <view class="r-art" style="box-shadow: 0 0 14rpx {{item.glow}}55;">
          <pixel-icon art-id="{{item.artId}}" size="72" />
        </view>
        <view class="col flex-1">
          <view class="r-line">
            <text class="r-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="r-tags px" wx:if="{{item.tagsTxt}}">{{item.tagsTxt}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="r-en px" wx:if="{{item.en}}">{{item.en}}</text>
          <text class="r-acq" wx:if="{{item.acqTxt}}">📦 {{item.acqTxt}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="tag {{item.type === 'boss' ? 'tag-boss' : (item.type === 'mon' ? 'tag-mon' : (item.type === 'seed' ? 'tag-seed' : (item.type === 'npc' ? 'tag-npc' : 'tag-item')))}}">
          {{item.type === 'boss' ? 'BOSS' : (item.type === 'mon' ? '敌怪' : (item.type === 'seed' ? '种子' : (item.type === 'npc' ? 'NPC' : '物品')))}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{recipeHits.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">合成配方</text></view>
      <view class="rc-item card tappable" wx:for="{{recipeHits}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onRecipe" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <view class="r-art">
          <pixel-icon art-id="{{item.artId}}" size="56" />
        </view>
        <text class="rc-t flex-1">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="rc-go">合成树 ›</text>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{stratHits.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">相关攻略</text></view>
      <view class="st-item card tappable" wx:for="{{stratHits}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onStrat" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <view class="st-diamond" />
        <text class="st-t flex-1">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="st-go">›</text>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{catalogHits.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">全物品图鉴</text></view>
      <view class="r-item card tappable" wx:for="{{catalogHits}}" wx:key="f" bindtap="onCatalog" data-vol="{{item.vol}}" data-f="{{item.f}}">
        <image class="r-img" src="/pkg-cat-{{item.vol}}/assets/{{item.f}}.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <view class="col flex-1">
          <view class="r-line">
            <text class="r-name">{{item.n}}</text>
            <text class="r-tags px" wx:if="{{item.c}}">{{item.c}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="r-acq">{{item.en}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="tag tag-item" wx:if="{{item.d}}">{{item.d}} 伤害</text>
        <text class="tag tag-item" wx:else>全物品</text>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{fishingHits.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">钓鱼图鉴</text></view>
      <view class="r-item card tappable" wx:for="{{fishingHits}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onFish" data-kw="{{item.name}}">
        <view class="r-art">{{item.kind === 'quest' ? '🎣' : (item.kind === 'food' ? '🐟' : (item.kind === 'gear' ? '🧪' : (item.kind === 'bait' ? '🐛' : '📦')))}}</view>
        <view class="col flex-1">
          <view class="r-line">
            <text class="r-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="r-tags px">{{item.kindN}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="r-acq" wx:if="{{item.info}}">{{item.info}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="tag tag-item">钓鱼</text>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{guideHits.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">Boss 攻略清单</text></view>
      <view class="st-item card tappable" wx:for="{{guideHits}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onGuide" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <view class="st-diamond" />
        <text class="st-t flex-1">👹 {{item.name}} · 攻略清单</text>
        <text class="st-go">›</text>
      </view>

      <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!results.length && !stratHits.length && !recipeHits.length && !fishingHits.length && !guideHits.length && !catalogHits.length}}">
        <view class="e-icon">🌑</view>
        <text>没有找到「{{kw}}」，换个关键词试试</text>
      </view>
    </block>

    <!-- 默认：历史 + 热门 -->
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="sec-title" wx:if="{{hist.length}}"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">搜索历史</text>
        <text class="more" bindtap="clearHist">清空</text>
      </view>
      <view class="words" wx:if="{{hist.length}}">
        <view class="word-chip" wx:for="{{hist}}" wx:key="*this" bindtap="onWord" data-w="{{item}}">{{item}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="sec-title"><view class="diamond" /><text class="t">热门搜索</text>
        <text class="more px">HOT</text>
      </view>
      <view class="words">
        <view class="word-chip hot" wx:for="{{hotWords}}" wx:key="*this" bindtap="onWord" data-w="{{item}}">
          <text class="w-fire" wx:if="{{index < 3}}">🔥</text>{{item}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
    <view class="pad-bottom" />
  </scroll-view>
</view>

<cat-detail item="{{catDetail}}" bind:close="onCatDetailClose" />
